{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 2520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Probability inequalities and concentration bounds\n\nRead the target event and interpret its upper guarantee. A nonnegative variable and its mean support Markov; a finite variance supports Chebyshev; finite exponential moments support exponential Markov. Independent bounded sums give useful exponential-moment bounds. For event counts, begin with [[指示变量与随机计数.canvas|indicator modelling]].\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n概率不等式与集中界：先写事件并读懂上界保证。非负性与均值支持 Markov，有限方差支持 Chebyshev，有限指数矩支持指数 Markov；独立有界和便于控制指数矩。事件计数先使用指示变量建模。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[尾界含义|Interpreting a tail bound]]\n\nAn upper bound limits the probability; it does not estimate its location. Compare valid bounds with one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n尾界含义：上界限制概率，并不定位真值；有效的界还应与 1 取最小值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[概率界选择|Choosing a probability bound]]\n\nFix the event, threshold and available assumptions before comparing valid candidates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n概率界选择：先固定事件、阈值与已知条件，再比较条件成立的候选界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Markov不等式|Markov's inequality]]\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n*Markov 不等式*\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAn almost-sure indicator comparison turns a nonnegative variable’s mean into an upper-tail bound.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n用几乎处处成立的指示变量比较，把非负变量的均值转为右尾上界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 支持集改进\n\n[[平移Markov界|shifted Markov：移除已知基线]]\n\n下界必须 almost surely 成立。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 二阶入口\n\n[[和的方差协方差项|variance of sum 要保留 covariance]]\n\npairwise uncorrelated 可逐项删交叉项；总和抵消也可能使方差相加。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 平方变换\n\n[[Chebyshev不等式|Chebyshev：对 squared deviation 用 Markov]]\n\nfinite variance 给双侧 polynomial tail。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Independence 边界\n\n[[两两独立不推出相互独立|pairwise 不推出 mutual]]\n\n二阶 covariance 与联合 MGF 需要的独立层级不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指数Markov法|Exponential Markov method]]\n\nApply Markov to an exponential transform, then optimise over positive parameters with finite MGF. Mutual independence permits product factorisation for sums.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n指数 Markov：对指数变换用 Markov，再在 MGF 有限的正参数中优化。相互独立保证和的矩母函数乘积分解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘法Chernoff上界|Multiplicative Chernoff]]\n\nIndependent $[0,1]$ contributions; a threshold $(1+\\delta)\\mu$, $\\delta\\ge0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n独立的零到一贡献之和，控制相对均值的上尾。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hoeffding不等式|Hoeffding's inequality]]\n\nIndependent bounded terms; squared interval widths control $S-E[S]$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n相互独立、有界的加数：用各区间宽度平方之和控制加性偏差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本均值Hoeffding界|Hoeffding for an average]]\n\nFor independent $[0,1]$ observations and $\\varepsilon>0$, bound $P(|\\bar Y-E[\\bar Y]|\\ge\\varepsilon)$ by $\\min\\{1,2e^{-2n\\varepsilon^2}\\}$. Set $t=n\\varepsilon$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n以平均值自身的期望为中心；用 $t=n\\varepsilon$ 换算总偏差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0009-mgf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩母函数|Moment-generating function]]\n\n$M_X(s)=E[e^{sX}]$ averages exponentially transformed values. Check its finite domain; a neighbourhood of zero permits derivatives to generate moments.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n矩母函数：先指数变换，再按概率平均。要核对有限定义域；零附近有限时可求导得到矩。"
    }
  ],
